          "settings": {
            "question": "What is a serving size?",
            "answer": "<p>For our cacao we have found 20 g as a base dosage is great start, however here's a guide to finding what's right for you</p><p>~ 11g A micro-chocolatey dose with mild flavor and not too much strength.</p><p>~ 22g A great dose for daily ritual, rich in flavor, not overwhelmingly strong </p><p>~ 33g A strong dose, packed with all of the benefits of cacao, you will definitely be feeling A LOT!</p><p>~ 44g We call this \"Shamanic\" Only for the serious cacao journeyers. Anymore will cause headaches </p>"
          }
